: no-arguments
:
$*

: print-usage
:
$* --help >>EOO
SYNOPSIS

launcher --help
launcher --version

DESCRIPTION

The launcher program is the launcher and updater of IW4x. It runs on players'
computers and on headless servers.

In this version the program prints its usage and version.

OPTIONS

--help      Print usage information and exit.

--version   Print version and exit.

EXIT STATUS

Non-zero exit status is returned in case of an error.
EOO

: print-version
:
$* --version >>"EOO"
launcher $version.project_id
Copyright \(c\) the IW4x authors.
This is free software released under the GNU General Public License, version 3,
with the IW4x Linking Exception, version 1.1.
EOO

: unknown-option
: Test handling of an option that is not ours
:
$* --frobnicate 2>>EOE != 0
error: unknown option '--frobnicate'
  info: run 'launcher --help' for more information
EOE

: unknown-argument
: Test handling of an argument when none is taken
:
$* game 2>>EOE != 0
error: unknown argument 'game'
  info: run 'launcher --help' for more information
EOE
